{"parse": {"title": "小狗与流浪汉-04", "pageid": 89611, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89-03\" title=\"小狗与流浪汉-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">小狗与流浪汉-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89-05\" title=\"小狗与流浪汉-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">小狗与流浪汉</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B3.A1.E6.B3.A1.E7.A2.B0.E6.92.9E.E6.9C.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"泡泡碰撞机\">泡泡碰撞机</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 泡泡碰撞机</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Bubble Crash</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shezhengjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shezhengjie\"><img alt=\"shezhengjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/600px-Cg-shezhengjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/900px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/1200px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪，汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>獒！<i>&lt;是温迪！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……呜呜……汪……<i>&lt;抱歉……请让一下……抱歉……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>混乱的人群构成了不可突破的牢笼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>激动的小斗牛犬全然无视了身后的呼喊，灵活地在人群中穿梭着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毛茸茸的短尾巴左躲右闪，显然，它的突破之路比那位黑白花纹的同行者要顺利得多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪呜？<i>&lt;你已经出去了？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜，汪，汪汪汪……<i>&lt;抱歉，请等等我，我这边并不顺利……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>獒！<i>&lt;噢！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牧羊犬的步伐戛然而止，这及时阻止了他撞到路灯上的惨剧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>来吧！新世界的朋友们！乌托邦的主人！我们的未来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>循着声音抬头望去，路灯上，衣着鲜艳的邋遢男人深深地吸了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呼——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……<i>&lt;这个声音……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人头上的绑带在阳光下显得十分鲜艳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>棒极了，双头蛇蛋液新配方效果显著！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这是属于你我的时代！来吧！让我看看你们眼中的美好世界！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺，狺狺……<i>&lt;我记得，他是……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺！狺狺。<i>&lt;哦！原来人们古怪的反应来自于那些过于活泼的小圆球。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;这太糟了。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>混乱自层积云中心的小漩涡迅速扩散开来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——这是一场雷暴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>獒，嗷嗷！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>流动的人群外，找不到朋友的小斗牛犬困惑地吠叫着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这当然不是它能解决的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;我感觉我的肋骨出现了诸多不适。&gt;</i><br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺。<i>&lt;使用能力不是什么好点子。&gt;</i><br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……狺狺狺。<i>&lt;……肥皂泡是意料之外的劫难，它们让我的爪子也变得黏黏糊糊。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;这是由无知带来的苦果，人们通常称之为后悔。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>獒！吽吽。<i>&lt;噢！轻些，我的脚。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空想的青年Ⅲ：</div><div>这儿有一只，嗝，波格雅恩……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>凝视肥皂泡过久的陌生男人用力地揉搓着皮克勒斯的毛发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空想的青年Ⅲ：</div><div>啊哈！我找到了波格雅恩！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯肋下感到了巨大的推力，紧接着眼前便开阔了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人将牧羊犬高高举起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，呜呜……<i>&lt;哦，我的天……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个高度对一只边境牧羊犬来说显然不是什么好兆头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜呜……<i>&lt;这太高了……我、我看到了太阳……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，呜，吽吽……<i>&lt;这并不舒适，拜托，放我下来……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这位先生就像吃了不该吃的蘑菇一样快乐。 </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>流动着七彩光晕的圆形肥皂泡缓缓捉住了那颗黑色的、湿漉漉的鼻尖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“啵。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……狺狺？<i>&lt;这是……主动飘过来的肥皂泡？它们似乎有……自己的意识……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不可被察觉的混沌缓缓攀上他的脑海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺……狺……狺狺狺……<i>&lt;真是好看的圆形……很完美……像欧几里得的……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“啵。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……狺狺。<i>&lt;噢……我闻到了羊皮纸的味道。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亮金色的门在小狗面前徐徐打开。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_xiaogouyadianxueyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_xiaogouyadianxueyuan\"><img alt=\"at_xiaogouyadianxueyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-at_xiaogouyadianxueyuan.png/600px-Cg-at_xiaogouyadianxueyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-at_xiaogouyadianxueyuan.png/900px-Cg-at_xiaogouyadianxueyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-at_xiaogouyadianxueyuan.png/1200px-Cg-at_xiaogouyadianxueyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……狺？狺狺……狺？<i>&lt;我穿着……白色的袍子？这里是……希腊？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雅典学院的拱门前，智者们位列在他的两边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺……狺，狺狺？<i>&lt;理想的国度……现在，我更应当蜷缩在木桶里吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺，狺狺狺？<i>&lt;或者，在洞穴之中观摩那些灵动的黑影？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺，狺狺狺。<i>&lt;不，我应当弄清楚苹果中心的星星……和甜甜圈上那个充满意义的洞。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shezhengjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shezhengjie\"><img alt=\"shezhengjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/600px-Cg-shezhengjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/900px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/1200px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群的喧闹声像隔着一层坚韧的膜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺？狺？<i>&lt;我回到故乡了吗？回到希腊？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺？<i>&lt;这里是什么地方？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺，狺狺？<i>&lt;我是谁，我为何存在于此呢？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>嘿，注意点朋友，可别让我在新世界里跌跤！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你——嗯？还有小狗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>啊！这个毛色……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽，汪汪。<i>&lt;头饰，以及过长的头发。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺，狺狺狺。<i>&lt;哦，宗教也应当是一种哲学。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗表现出了他的认可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>可不是嘛，抢了新时代艺术风头的毛茸茸小怪物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术背对着人群蹲下身来，捏了捏皮克勒斯的爪子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嗯，但不得不说这触感，或许值得——一瞬间的风光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>咳咳，你来参加了派对，这相当值得嘉奖……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哈！我可没那么蠢，你是与你的主人走散了，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜呜，汪汪汪？<i>&lt;我不太明白这个关于主人的话题，您是在与我探讨自我认知方面的问题吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢，从你的语气上来说我猜得好像不太对头？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。汪汪汪，汪。<i>&lt;我觉得我应当尽快前往希腊。他们邀请了所有对哲学有追求的生命，那儿在等待着我。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗要去远方流浪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>流浪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对流浪颇具经验的男人扬起了眉毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>像我一样，为了自由流浪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪汪，汪汪。<i>&lt;我想您误会了，这是一种求得真理的过程，并不是毫无目的的巡游。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗要追寻自己的理想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦，嘿！你真的只是一只猎犬吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽，吽吽，汪。<i>&lt;从生物的角度上说，是牧羊犬，边境牧羊犬。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我的知音竟是一只黑白花纹的猎犬！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪……呜呜？<i>&lt;我觉得您需要增加对世界的认知……您渴望追求真理吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗想要探寻起源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢，你原来是只艺术原理爱好狗？\t</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>不过，没错……这点我还算认可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>正所谓“巴黎是艺术之都”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>尽管那群傲慢的法国佬看上去总是带点不开心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>但不可否认，他们是浪漫主义的行家～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>可要我说，那儿也该有一场革新了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人抓着爪子的手紧了紧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嘿……你提醒我了，小家伙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪？<i>&lt;嗯？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我们不当只满足于一场盛会！\t</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>宣扬艺术就该去真正的艺术之都！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他义愤填膺地直起身，像是背负着重要的使命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>想象一下，当我们在协和广场上的传奇演说传遍整个巴黎……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>新思想将在异国刮起一场飓风！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪？<i>&lt;飓风？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这是绝妙的主意！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>你我志同道合，我们应组成一个牢不可破的联盟！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>来吧，我的盟友——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>提高行动力是掀起艺术新潮的先决条件！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜？<i>&lt;嗯？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>层积云自他们两侧分流远去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>现在……让我们看看……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人双手叉腰，志得意满地打量着一地狼藉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>该去哪儿才能拿到打开艺术之都的钥匙呢？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "小狗与流浪汉-04"}}